From e17114f0dd5b34d3c78db144f206d0a0a23f8e32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 20:44:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Display kets as column vectors in second_quantization
 notebook

Operators acting on kets now print their results as N x 1 column
vectors via a show_ket helper, replacing .ravel() row output. The
markdown now states that an operator acting on a ket returns a ket
(a column vector). Also fixes a '|3|' typo and re-executes the notebook.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JqDcAipPCQdaFbR6o4oeeD
